      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-energy ball milling followed by spark plasma sintering can produce the NbMoCrTiAl composite.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-energy ball milling followed by optimized spark plasma sintering will produce uniformly dispersed nanoscale TiC and Al2O3 particles.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing reinforcement particle size decreases stress concentrations at reinforcement–matrix interfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed processing and particle refinement promote refinement of the BCC matrix grains.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nanoscale TiC and Al2O3 particles provide more effective dispersion strengthening than coarse particles.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined microstructure facilitates homogeneous plastic deformation through grain-boundary sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined microstructure enhances activation of multiple slip systems.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Second-phase and grain-boundary strengthening increase yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nanoscale particle refinement will simultaneously increase yield strength and strain-to-failure relative to the coarse-particle baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
